## Graph Data Rules
- Every node must have: id, label, type, tier, investigation, detail
- Every edge must have: source, target, type, flow, label
- Valid types: actor, judge, political, school, entity, enforcement, institutional
- Valid flows: money, power, influence, position
- Valid investigations: detroit, saginaw, barry, eastpointe, shared
- Every node needs a source citation (LARA, ICHAT, PACER, etc.)
- Run `python api/build-unified-graph.py` after graph data changes

## Content Format
- All pages use Zola TOML frontmatter (`+++` blocks)
- Every page needs: title, description, weight
- Every factual claim must have a source citation
- Unsourced items go in investigation checklists as `- [ ]` items, NOT as findings

