## Commit Messages
Descriptive. Name what was added, what investigations are affected, what sources were used. Example:
```
Add Ellison entity network nodes: OLC PLC, Quagmire Solutions, FOIAworks

Sources: LARA, WHOIS, barry.primals.eco actor pages
Investigations affected: saginaw, shared (AGC cross-reference)
```
